            "review_title": "Review at SumoBBQ",
            "review_text": "Anya B\nParanaque, Philippines6 contributions\n0\nExtra Special Service\nAug 2016 • Couples\nMy husband and I decided to try out SumoBBQ before going to the airport. We knew we will have a challenge speaking with them because of the language barrier, but once Ms. Tho heard us, she immediately took over and assisted us during our whole meal. She didn't speak a lot of English, but she said she can understand us well, so it was much easier communicating with us. She was extra patient with delivering what we needed despite our differences, and we're very thankful that she made our last meal in Hanoi a special one. Kudos to Tho!\nRead more\nWritten August 30, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
